  - States reproduced + widened to the P4 envelope: content (chip row) / loading
    (skeleton) / empty (web empty group) / error (QueryError+retry) / stale / offline.
    "Stale" is genuinely meaningful here: a row resolved before midnight goes stale
    once "Today" rolls (the web source's wall-clock caveat) — modelled as day-rollover.
  - Diagnostics: model emits view.opened with slug "DatePresetChips" once on appear.
  - Accessibility: role=group label (web aria-label); each chip carries isSelected
    (web aria-pressed) + a combined "Title, selected" VoiceOver label.

